swim team disbands afterwards, as Asahi Shiina moves away and Ikuya studies abroad. In present time, Haruka prepares for the tournaments with his teammates Makoto Tachibana, Nagisa Hazuki, and Rei Ryugazaki, while Rin, who has since reconciled with him, does the same. Though Haruka is in his final year of high school, he has not yet decided on what he wants to do after graduating, even after being scouted by a college during the prefectural tournaments. Meanwhile, Makoto becomes inspired to become a swim coach after helping Kisumi Shigino's little brother, Hayato, learn how to swim.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/270065/7149123.jpg"}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-01T08:31:58Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:98497","mal:35198"],"imdbSource":"anibridge-v3","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10415","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"11155","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"12332","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"12996","scope":"R","ranges":{"1":"1","1-4|-4":"1"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"14415","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"14601","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"107202"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"107203"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"133124"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21091"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21158"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98495"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98497","ranges":{"1":"1-4|-4"}},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt10621390"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt14531302"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt19849494"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt4872210"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt6799508"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt8141908","ranges":{"1":"1","1-4|-4":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"19671"},{"provider":"mal","id":"26213"},{"provider":"mal","id":"30415"},{"provider":"mal","id":"33845"},{"provider":"mal","id":"35198","ranges":{"1-4|-4":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"37860","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"mal","id":